# Kernel-version lane (samples/linux-kernel-ci, xfrm build in a cloud
# image guest; distro OpenSSL, no ADDKE build).
gate addke RFC 9370 ADDKE rows run on the Fedora lane
gate dpd   11-timer DPD ladder (~16 min) is box-only
gate box   new rows are box-verified before CI admits them
gate pfkey Linux pfkey-backend rows run in the pfkey lane only
gate charonv1 strongSwan >= 6.1 (Debian sid) has no IKEv1; skipped only when libcharon proves it (run.sh charon_ikev1_absent)
